# Admin Assets

## JavaScript (`admin/js/launchdek-admin.js`)

- Wrap in an IIFE with `'use strict'`; guard on `typeof launchdekAdmin`.
- REST helpers: `request()`, `get()`, `post()`, `put()`, `del()` — all send `X-WP-Nonce` header. `buildApiUrl(path)` / `splitApiPath()` / `mergeExtraQuery()` build URLs for pretty (`/wp-json/`) and plain (`?rest_route=`) permalinks; `buildPlainPermalinkFallbackUrl()` retries on `rest_no_route` when pretty permalinks are configured but rewrites are broken (common on local MAMP).
- DOM helpers: `el( tag, attrs, children )`, `fillSelect( select, items, valueKey, labelKey, placeholder )`; notices via `notice( container, message, type )`.
- Scope queries to `.launchdek-admin` or `[data-launchdek-page]`.
- No jQuery unless WordPress already loads it.
- On `DOMContentLoaded`: set `data-launchdek-ready="true"`, then call global modal inits (`initTemplatePicker`, `initOnboarding`, `initConfirmModal`) before page inits; `initSettings()` runs last.

### Global modal inits (any screen with modal markup)

| Function | Modal | Notes |
|----------|-------|-------|
| `initTemplatePicker()` | `#launchdek-template-picker-modal` | Runs when modal partial is present; exposes `window.launchdekOpenTemplatePicker(callbacks)` |
| `initOnboarding()` | `#launchdek-onboarding-modal` | Runs when modal partial is present; exposes `window.launchdekOpenOnboarding()` |
| `initConfirmModal()` | `#launchdek-confirm-modal` | Runs when confirm partial is present; `openConfirmModal({ message, title?, confirmText?, destructive?, onConfirm })` — focus trap, backdrop close, destructive uses `.button-link-delete` |

### Page init functions

| Function | Page attr | Key elements |
|----------|-----------|--------------|
