| `initSettings()` | `settings` | `#launchdek-panel-layout` + `#launchdek-panel-layout-preview` (`initPanelLayoutPreview()` — syncs `data-layout` and description on change); `#launchdek-show-onboarding` → `POST /onboarding/reset` then `launchdekOpenOnboarding()` |
| `initSites()` | `sites` | toolbar (`#launchdek-add-site`, `#launchdek-connection-tester`, `#launchdek-activity-logs` → Activity Logs page), tag/group filters, `#launchdek-sites-table` (`.launchdek-site-row` + expandable `.launchdek-site-runs-row` with `.launchdek-site-history-toggle` → `GET /sites/{id}/runs?limit=25&offset=` paginated via `loadSiteRuns()` / `loadMoreSiteRuns()`; combined Status column `.launchdek-site-status` with connection dot + health badge; Actions split button `.launchdek-site-actions-dropdown` — Edit + menu (Push Checklist, Test); run history **View run** split button with dropdown — Edit/Duplicate/Export/Archive/Delete; Steps column with `.launchdek-run-progress`; delete uses `openConfirmModal()`), site modal (`#launchdek-site-modal`, panel install/retry via `GET /panel/bootstrap` download + `retryPanelInstall()` → `POST /sites/{id}/panel/install`), push checklist modal (`#launchdek-push-checklist-modal`, `#launchdek-push-checklist-select`, `#launchdek-push-to-client`, `POST /runs` with `push_to_client`), shared confirm modal partial, standalone connection tester modal; `refreshStaleSiteConnectionsInBackground()` re-tests sites older than 30 minutes |
| `initActivityLogs()` | `activity-logs` | filters (`#launchdek-activity-logs-site`, `#launchdek-activity-logs-status`, `#launchdek-activity-logs-date-from`, `#launchdek-activity-logs-date-to`, `#launchdek-activity-logs-search`, `#launchdek-activity-logs-filter`), table `#launchdek-activity-logs-table`; loads `GET /logs/feed?detailed=1` (limit 200); honors `?site_id=` query param |
| `initChecklists()` | `checklists` | nav-tab section toggle (`.launchdek-checklist-nav`, `[data-launchdek-tab]`, `[data-launchdek-tab-panel]` — `templates|my-checklists|new-checklist|auto-capture`); **New Checklist** tab (`#launchdek-new-from-template`, `#launchdek-new-blank`, `#launchdek-new-browse-templates`) opens template picker or blank then switches to **My Checklists**; **Auto-Capture** tab is inline (`#launchdek-panel-auto-capture`); **My Checklists** panel: `#launchdek-checklist-select` dropdown, editor (`#launchdek-checklist-editor`), vertical canvas (`#launchdek-checklist-canvas`, `#launchdek-canvas-steps`, `.launchdek-canvas-node-chevron` toggles step config), step config (`#launchdek-step-config`, `#ld-step-role-mapping` multicheck dropdown, `#ld-step-deeplink` with live inference via `POST /checklists/infer-deep-link`, `#ld-step-show-note` / `#ld-step-show-screenshot` for manual `show_note_field` / `show_screenshot_field`, `#ld-validate-api` shows validation `errors` and `warnings` from `/checklists/{id}/validate-step`), save/export/delete/import controls |
| `initAutomation()` | `automation` | batch queue (`#launchdek-batch-table`, `#launchdek-run-checklist`), run controls (`#launchdek-run-steps`, `#launchdek-run-auto`, `#launchdek-run-next`, `#launchdek-run-push-client` — hidden until a run is active; posts `POST /runs/{id}/push-client` for snapshot re-push + bundle sync), run tracker renders step notes (`.launchdek-run-step-notes`, author · timestamp meta, optional `.launchdek-run-step-note-attachment` thumbnails), client-completed manual steps show `.launchdek-double-tick` SVG icon when `manual_checked`, and hub-side **Mark Complete** / **Mark Not Complete** (`.launchdek-complete-step` / `.launchdek-uncomplete-step` → `/complete` / `/uncomplete`); honors `?run_id=` deep link on load; audit filters/table (`#launchdek-audit-*`), drift panel (`#launchdek-drift-status`, `#launchdek-verify-drift`) |
| `initTemplates()` | checklists (Templates tab) | no-ops unless `#launchdek-builtin-templates` exists; category tabs (`#launchdek-category-tabs`, `#launchdek-category-description`), built-in grid, custom checklists (`#launchdek-custom-checklists`), vault save (`#launchdek-vault-checklist`, `#launchdek-save-vault`), vault list (`#launchdek-vault-list`) |
