Each page init no-ops if `[data-launchdek-page="{page}"]` is absent (except `initTemplates()`, which keys off `#launchdek-builtin-templates`). Modal inits no-op if their modal element is absent.

### Sites page run history

Key elements: `.launchdek-site-history-toggle`, `.launchdek-site-runs-row`, `.launchdek-site-runs-panel`, `.launchdek-site-runs-table`, `.launchdek-run-actions-dropdown`, `.launchdek-site-runs-load-more`.

- `toggleSiteRuns( siteId )` / `setSiteHistoryOpen()` — expand/collapse nested runs row; toggles `.is-history-open` on parent `.launchdek-site-row`.
- `loadSiteRuns( siteId, panel )` — fetches `GET /sites/{id}/runs?limit=25&offset=0`, caches in `siteRunsCache` with in-flight dedup (`siteRunsPending`); `normalizeSiteRunsResponse()` handles legacy array or `{ runs, has_more }` shape.
- `loadMoreSiteRuns( siteId, panel, btn )` — appends next page when `has_more`; `siteRunsMorePending` prevents duplicate requests.
- `invalidateSiteRunsCache( siteId )` — clears cache and re-fetches when panel is open after push/archive/delete.
- `renderSiteRunsPanel()` — checklist title, Steps progress (`.launchdek-run-progress`), started/completed timestamps, started-by, split **View run** + actions menu (`runActionsHtml()` / `bindRunActions()`).
- `duplicateRunChecklist()` — clones built-in via `POST /templates/{slug}/clone` or custom via `GET` + `POST /checklists`; `exportRunChecklist()` downloads JSON export.
- Archive → `POST /runs/{id}/archive`; Delete → `openConfirmModal()` then `DELETE /runs/{id}`.

### Checklists page sections

- `initChecklistTabs()` — toggles `[data-launchdek-tab-panel]` via `.launchdek-checklist-nav` `[data-launchdek-tab]` buttons; lazy-inits auto-capture site select when **Auto-Capture** tab opens (`initAutoCapturePanel()`); updates `?tab=` via `history.replaceState` (`templates` clears param; leaving **My Checklists** clears `checklist_id`). Legacy `?tab=builder` normalizes to `my-checklists`.
- Initial panel: `my-checklists` when `?checklist_id=` or `?tab=my-checklists` (or legacy `builder`), else `templates` (default).
- `fetchCustomChecklistSummaries( forceRefresh? )` — cached `GET /checklists?is_template=0&summary=1`; uses `launchdekAdmin.customChecklists` when `preloaded`; `invalidateCustomChecklistSummaries()` on mutations.
- `refreshCustomChecklistUi( forceRefresh? )` — one fetch updates `#launchdek-custom-checklists` grid, `#launchdek-checklist-select`, and `#launchdek-vault-checklist`; custom cards use `.launchdek-template-card--custom` with **Edit Checklist** + **Use Checklist** (no steps preview toggle).
- `loadChecklistList()` — delegates to `refreshCustomChecklistUi()`; change handler on `#launchdek-checklist-select` loads editor or hides it when empty.
- `openChecklistEditor( id )` — switches to **My Checklists** tab, sets `?tab=my-checklists&checklist_id=`, loads editor.
- `createChecklistFromTemplate( slug )` / `duplicateChecklist( tpl )` — clone via REST (`duplicateChecklist` fetches full checklist first) then `openChecklistEditor()`; built-in/vault cards use **Use Checklist** (`.launchdek-template-use-checklist`).
- Deep-link inference: `hydrateStepDeepLinks()`, `scheduleDeepLinkInference()` (300ms debounce), `runDeepLinkInference()` — client-side rules + `POST /checklists/infer-deep-link`; `deep_link_auto` / `deep_link_manual` track auto vs user-edited paths; hint via `#ld-step-deeplink-hint`. Field tooltips render icon-before-label via `renderFieldLabel()` / `renderFieldInfo()`.

### Auto-capture helpers

Key elements: `#launchdek-panel-auto-capture`, `.launchdek-auto-capture-panel`, `#launchdek-auto-capture-site`, `#launchdek-auto-capture-status`, `#launchdek-auto-capture-steps`, `#launchdek-auto-capture-start`, `#launchdek-auto-capture-stop`, `#launchdek-auto-capture-import`, `#launchdek-auto-capture-clear`, `#launchdek-auto-capture-notice`.

- `initAutoCapture()` — binds capture controls when `#launchdek-auto-capture-site` exists; no-ops otherwise.
- `initAutoCapturePanel()` — lazy-init on first **Auto-Capture** tab visit; site select populated from sites with `client_agent`.
- `renderCaptureStatus( data )` — toggles recording UI (`.is-recording` on status), step list, and action button visibility; loads `GET /sites/{id}/capture` on site change.
- **Start Recording** → `POST /sites/{id}/capture` `{ action: 'start' }`; **Stop** → `{ action: 'stop' }`; **Clear** → `DELETE /sites/{id}/capture`.
- **Import Captured Steps** — maps captured steps into builder via `newChecklist()` + `renderSteps()`, then switches to **My Checklists** (requires client panel on selected site).

### Template picker helpers

Key elements: `#launchdek-template-picker-filters`, `#launchdek-template-picker-list`, `#launchdek-template-picker-steps`, `#launchdek-template-picker-steps-list`, `#launchdek-template-picker-notice`, `#launchdek-template-picker-blank`, `#launchdek-template-picker-cancel`, `#launchdek-template-picker-import`.

- `loadPickerTemplates()` — caches `GET /templates` (`builtin`, `categories`).
- `openTemplatePicker(callbacks)` — opens modal; callbacks: `{ importMode?, onImport, onBlank }`. Default `importMode` is `checklist` (`POST /templates/{slug}/clone` → `onImport(checklist)`); `populate` passes template object to `onImport` (onboarding paste flow). Exposed as `window.launchdekOpenTemplatePicker`.
- `closeTemplatePicker()`, `importSelectedTemplate()` — close on backdrop/close/cancel; import on **Import Template** (`#launchdek-template-picker-import`, disabled until a template is selected).
- `renderPickerFilters()`, `renderPickerList()`, `renderPickerStepsPreview()` — category capsule tabs, selectable list items (`.launchdek-template-picker-item.is-selected`), steps aside.
- `templateToPasteText( template )` — converts template title + step titles to plain-text SOP format for onboarding paste field.
- `updatePickerImportButton()` — enables/disables import button based on `pickerSelectedSlug`.

### Onboarding helpers

- `parsePastedChecklist( text )` — parses headings, bullets, and numbered lines into `{ title, steps[] }`.
- `buildChecklistPayload( parsed )` — converts parsed steps to manual checklist REST payload.
- `getPasteText()` — returns trimmed textarea value, falling back to placeholder when empty (used for step validation).
- `getPreviewSourceText()` — returns `{ text, isSample }`; when textarea is empty, renders placeholder as a dimmed sample preview (`.is-sample`, disabled checkboxes).
- `updateOnboardingProgress( step )` — toggles `.is-active` / `.is-complete` on `#launchdek-onboarding-progress` segment nodes (`data-step="1|2"`).
- `updateStep2SiteState()` — syncs `#launchdek-onboarding-site` selection with connect panel visibility and connection status.
- `closeOnboarding()` — sets `modal.hidden = true` immediately (no network wait).
- `dismissOnboarding()` — `POST /onboarding/dismiss` (fire-and-forget).
- `dismissAndCloseOnboarding()` — close icon, backdrop, and Skip buttons; closes UI first, then persists dismiss in background.
- `openOnboardingModal()` / `resetOnboardingModal()` — exposed as `window.launchdekOpenOnboarding`; resets form state before each open.
- `initOnboarding()` — 2-step modal flow:
  - **Step 1** (`#launchdek-onboarding-step-1`): paste SOP text (`#launchdek-onboarding-paste`) → live preview (`#launchdek-onboarding-preview`); placeholder shows sample preview until user types; **Start from a template** (`#launchdek-onboarding-use-template`) opens template picker with `importMode: populate`.
  - **Step 2** (`#launchdek-onboarding-step-2`): optional existing-site select (`#launchdek-onboarding-site`) or new-site connect panel (`#launchdek-onboarding-connect-panel`, `/sites/test`, `/sites`) → save checklist (`POST /checklists`) → optional run (`POST /runs`) → dismiss (`POST /onboarding/dismiss`).
  - Auto-opens when `data-launchdek-page="dashboard"` and `launchdekAdmin.onboarding.show` is true, or when URL has `?onboarding=1` (any page with modal markup); Settings **Show onboarding wizard** resets via `POST /onboarding/reset` then calls `launchdekOpenOnboarding()` — saving settings alone does not auto-open the wizard.

### `launchdekAdmin` shape

```javascript
{
	restUrl: string,    // rest_url( 'launchdek/v1' )
	nonce: string,      // wp_create_nonce( 'wp_rest' )
	adminUrl: string,
	pageSlug: string,
	roles: object,      // WP role slug => translated label (for step target_roles UI)
	dashboard: {              // present only on dashboard screen (toplevel_page_{slug})
		stats: object,        // sites_connected, active_checklists, runs_in_progress, completion_rate
		connections: object,  // healthy, unhealthy, unknown, total
		feed: array,          // latest 15 log entries (FEED_LIMIT)
		quickLaunch: {        // cached picker options (also rendered server-side in dashboard partial)
			sites: array,     // { id, name } max 100
			checklists: array // { id, title } max 100 non-template
		}
	},
	customChecklists: {         // present only on checklists screen
		preloaded: boolean,
		items: array            // summary_list rows (id, title, description, steps_count, steps preview)
	},
	onboarding: {
		show: boolean,          // ! onboarding_dismissed
		templatesUrl: string,   // admin.php?page={slug}-checklists (Templates default tab)
		checklistsUrl: string,  // admin.php?page={slug}-checklists&tab=my-checklists
		automationUrl: string,
		activityLogsUrl: string // admin.php?page={slug}-activity-logs
	},
	strings: {
